From 05e4cb152c518f4308a58a050f6e48ed0b53285c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: juanan <juanan@test.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 10:38:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] T8: QA hardening of the IED extension

- Declare Moodle 4.5 only (requires 2024100700, supported [405, 405]):
  the fork is only tested on 4.5.
- Escape the validator name in the "Grade validated by" badge.
- weights_editor: attach the listeners at once (the localised strings are
  loaded in the background) and recalculate on "Add criterion"; use a
  timeout instead of requestAnimationFrame, which does not run in pages
  that are not painted. Found in the browser QA.
- grade_validated event: instanceid as an integer.
- End to end test through assign::save_grade() down to the gradebook:
  weighted teacher grade, validated grade and ignored regrade; upstream
  grade with every feature disabled.
- Coding style (moodle-cs) of the lines added by the fork; upstream code
  is not reformatted.
- PATCHES.md: setup guide for site administrators and accepted
  limitations.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
